# Local overrides for the Makefile. Copy to `.env`, then uncomment only the
# lines you want to change. `.env` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# Every line here is commented on purpose: the Makefile uses `?=`, which treats
# an empty `PORT=` as "already defined" and would pass an empty --port. Copying
# this file unchanged therefore changes nothing.

# Angular dev-server port (heartbond-web pane; SpeakWith's site uses 4201).
# PORT=4202
